"Con N+1 sizing, you debería nunca allocate más de ``(N-1)/N`` de total "
"cluster memoria a VMs. Para un 3-nodo cluster, este means keeping 33% de "
"total capacidad free. Para un 5-nodo cluster, 20%."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:91
msgid "Maintenance Capacity"
msgstr "Maintenance Capacity"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:93
msgid ""
"Maintenance mode requires the same capacity headroom as failover — one "
"host worth of memory must be available across remaining hosts to evacuate"
" VMs during maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Mantenimiento modo requiere el mismo capacidad headroom como conmutación "
"por error — one host worth de memoria debe be disponible a través de "
"remaining hosts a evacuate VMs durante mantenimiento."

