" son treated como reservations. CPU scheduling es administrado por el "
"Linux kernel's CFS scheduler con KVM's virtual CPU mappings."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:167
msgid "Storage Capacity Planning"
msgstr "Storage Capacity Planning"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:169
msgid "Plan storage capacity considering:"
msgstr "Plan storage capacidad considering:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:171
msgid "**VM disk allocation** — Current storage usage plus growth projections"
msgstr "**VM disk allocation** — Actual storage usage plus growth projections"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:172
msgid ""
"**Heartbeat overhead** — Heartbeat files consume minimal space (~KB per "
"host per datastore)"
msgstr ""
"**Heartbeat overhead** — Heartbeat archivos consume minimal space (~KB "
"per host per datastore)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:173
msgid "**Snapshot space** — VM snapshots can consume significant temporary space"
msgstr ""
"**Snapshot space** — VM snapshots puede consume significant temporary "
"space"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:174
msgid ""
"**GFS2 journal overhead** — Each host requires a journal entry per "
"datastore (typically 128 MB per journal)"
msgstr ""
"**GFS2 journal overhead** — Cada host requiere un journal entrada per "
"datastore (típicamente 128 MB per journal)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:176
msgid ""
"Recommended free space threshold: **> 20%** on all HPE Clustered "
"Datastores."
msgstr ""
"Recommended free space threshold: **> 20%** en todos HPE Clustered "
"Almacenes de datos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:178
msgid ""
"Prefer adding another datastore before an existing datastore reaches the "
"threshold. If operational constraints require an in-place LUN/GFS2 "
"increase, use the single canonical, Support-gated procedure in "
":doc:`storage_operations`; do not treat array expansion alone as "
"filesystem growth."
msgstr "Preferible agregar otro almacén de datos antes de que un almacén de datos existente alcance el umbral. Si las restricciones operativas requieren un aumento in situ de LUN/GFS2, utilice el procedimiento canónico único, autorizado por Soporte, en :doc:`storage_operations`; no trate la expansión del array por sí sola como crecimiento del sistema de archivos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/capacity_planning.rst:180
msgid ""
"For multiple shared file-based datastores, an HVM Datastore Group can "
"select a member during provisioning and optionally rebalance eligible VM "
"disks when a member exceeds the configured utilization threshold. See "
":doc:`storage_operations`."
msgstr "Para varios almacenes de datos compartidos basados en archivos, un Grupo de almacenes de datos HVM puede seleccionar un miembro durante el aprovisionamiento y opcionalmente reequilibrar discos de VM elegibles cuando un miembro supera el umbral de utilización configurado. Consulte :doc:`storage_operations`."

